  "ingredients": [
    "3 cups bread flour",
    "3 tablespoons white sugar",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "0.25 cup dry milk powder",
    "1 cup warm water (110 degrees F/45 degrees C)",
    "2 tablespoons butter, softened",
    "1 (.25 ounce) package active dry yeast",
    "1 large egg white",
    "2 tablespoons water"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tRXP1zuou5noKQbEZ0zm55cm0SM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16223-bread-machine-rolls-DDMFS-033-4x3-step-01-4de9dc958a5542a399c61ac57723b8cc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16223/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place bread flour, sugar, salt, milk powder, 1 cup warm water, butter, and yeast into a bread machine in the order listed or follow the order recommended by the manufacturer if different.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/FFgWoO4iMc5t3YazoP2B_iCBidA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16223-bread-machine-rolls-DDMFS-035-4x3-step-02-e63dd73658f347f3aa83c751d9122f60.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16223/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Select Dough cycle; press Start.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SRxkKD-GOmyNPmKkSuPKG4Bgcj8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16223-bread-machine-rolls-DDMFS-040-4x3-step-03-c71e2183eaaa4c99afd6915987f7f0c8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16223/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, lightly grease a baking sheet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove dough from the machine, deflate, and turn out onto a lightly floured surface.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/J7HG9ZUKxnVTg2nO7H5aJyRimIk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16223-bread-machine-rolls-DDMFS-092-4x3-step-04-614e6dd8b299476699c5c91bec25a1fa.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16223/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide dough into 12 equal pieces, form into rounds, and place them on the prepared baking sheet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8jJ7Nn2rodi3pHFeL25AFFpdH1Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16223-bread-machine-rolls-DDMFS-095-4x3-step-06-548ad740bbfb491bbff16e161756c2c0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16223/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover with a damp cloth; let rise until doubled in size, about 40 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/N-jzN8Y5XqmKKyfYcg5LO-_O7cI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16223-bread-machine-rolls-DDMFS-102-4x3-step-07-60693d7665694084a2ab6b59f8998b6d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16223/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix together egg white and 2 tablespoons water in a small bowl; brush lightly onto the tops of risen rolls.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4v49yzSMnYi45EVqOAVbt-Do_SQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16223-bread-machine-rolls-DDMFS-103-4x3-step-08-702b55625bbd4b9e8db6e6ed8be7ca77.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/16223/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until rolls are golden brown, about 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/u-J3dNSJ4GhwVoRtUI5jx4DhIQQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/16223-bread-machine-rolls-DDMFS-112-4x3-step-09-bfad8b770af642a0a530cddde736e6f5.jpg"
      ],
